@startmindmap
' EKA-18 — Local Developer Stack / Compose Exposure Boundary (base 2bfda8e)
* Local dev stack: compose up to host listeners
** Quick Start doc
*** gebaut: README.md::Quick Start
*** offen: shared-network note (EKA-18 audit)
** Dev Compose db
*** gebaut: docker-compose.yml::services.db.ports 5432 (all interfaces)
*** gebaut: docker-compose.yml::services.db.environment POSTGRES_PASSWORD (dev fallback)
** Dev Compose redis
*** gebaut: docker-compose.yml::services.redis.ports 6379 (all interfaces, no auth)
** Dev Compose api
*** gebaut: docker-compose.yml::services.api.environment DATABASE_URL / REDIS_URL / SERVER_SALT
*** gebaut: service DNS db / redis (network default)
*** gebaut: docker-compose.yml::services.api.ports 8000
** API settings (host path)
*** gebaut: apps/api/config.py::Settings (localhost defaults)
*** gebaut: apps/api/alembic/env.py
*** gebaut: apps/api/database.py::engine
** Salt guard
*** gebaut: apps/api/security_startup.py::validate_server_salt_config
** Regression test
*** offen: dev compose exposure test
@endmindmap

